OL,3,GNEWSAPlot targeting Manchester's Jewish
OL,4,Acommunity disrupted, say police
OL,5,
OL,6,FA "suspected terrorist plot" to target
OL,7,Fthe Jewish community in Manchester is
OL,8,Fbelieved to have been foiled after two
OL,9,Fmen were arrested in the city on
OL,10,FSunday, police have said.
OL,12,FThe men, both in their 30s, were
OL,13,Fdetained on suspicion of offences under
OL,14,FSection 41 of the Terrorism Act 2000 in
OL,15,FNewton Street on Sunday, according to
OL,16,Fthe Metropolitan Police, which is
OL,17,Fleading the investigation.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
