OL,3,GNEWSAPlot targeting Manchester's Jewish
OL,4,Acommunity disrupted, say police
OL,5,
OL,6,FDeputy Assistant Commissioner Vicki
OL,7,FEvans said police were aware the news
OL,8,Fwould cause "further concern" to the
OL,9,FJewish community "especially given the
OL,10,Fsignificant High Holy day period".
OL,12,FThe two suspects remain in police
OL,13,Fcustody as investigations continue.
